nsumption services; professional services, including consulting, platform integration, training, and custom application and workflow development services; and advertising and game publishing services. It provides its solutions directly through its online store, field sales operations, independent distributors, and resellers. The company serves enterprises, mid-market companies, government, and non-profit institutions; mid-sized, small, and independent businesses; and individuals from various industries. Unity Software Inc. was founded in 2004 and is headquartered in San Francisco, California.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Matthew Samuel Bromberg J.D. | CEO, President & Director | Age 59 | Compensation: $1.8M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 4K people. Revenue per employee of $419K ranks in the above the sector median among Technology peers, with revenue growing 19%/yr across its filed history. Each employee generates $92K of free cash flow annually. Stock-based compensation of $87K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 4\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags elevated compensation governance risk (10/10).","financial_summary":["Unity Software Inc. is a large-cap technology business with a $19.9B market cap on $1.8B of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +10% over the past three years, a respectable pace for a business of this size.","Returns on capital run at -47% against a 13% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests. Gross margins of 74% confirm genuine pricing power.","The business throws off $404M in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 22 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders.","On the balance sheet, thin -20.0\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Shareholder yield is only 0.0%, a thin return of capital, and stock-based comp at 21% o